# Optional. Without a .env the map uses OpenFreeMap's free dark style (no key needed).
# To use another provider instead, copy to .env (same folder) and fill in. .env is git-ignored, so the key stays local.
# A raster tile URL with {z}/{x}/{y} (and optional {s} for a-d subdomains), including your key.

# Stadia Maps "Alidade Smooth Dark" (closest dark style; free for development):
# VITE_BASEMAP_URL=https://tiles.stadiamaps.com/tiles/alidade_smooth_dark/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?api_key=YOUR_KEY
# VITE_BASEMAP_ATTRIBUTION=© Stadia Maps © OpenMapTiles © OpenStreetMap contributors

# MapTiler "Dataviz Dark":
# VITE_BASEMAP_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/dataviz-dark/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY
# VITE_BASEMAP_ATTRIBUTION=© MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors

# CARTO "Dark Matter": paste the raster tile URL your CARTO account gives you, key included.
# VITE_BASEMAP_URL=
# VITE_BASEMAP_ATTRIBUTION=© OpenStreetMap contributors © CARTO
